+#### Push Notifications (optional)
+
+Fizzy can send browser push notifications, so that whatever lands in someone's
+notification tray also reaches their phone and desktop. To turn this on,
+generate a VAPID key pair and provide it to the app:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` - the public half of the key pair
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` - the private half of the key pair
+
+You can generate a key pair with:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner "puts WebPush.generate_key.to_h"
+```
+
 #### S3 storage (optional)
 
 If you'd prefer that uploaded files were stored in an S3 bucket rather than in your mounted volume, you can set that up.
